iginal -13-to-zero penalty scale, while positive points use the full +31 attainable rule-catalogue range before reaching 26/26. This prevents routine positive stacks from saturating the component.","internal_coherence":"Sum tactic-to-tactic coherence rule points. Raw 0 maps to 9/18; the recovered companion-rule range -10..+26 maps piecewise to 0..9..18. Contradictions therefore remain strong while positive coherence no longer saturates after only +9 raw points.","playstyle_and_sa_fit":"No active semantic match scores 0. Active, assigned-role-eligible Playstyle affinities and active Special Ability affinities contribute their declared companion points, alongside contextual semantic rules. The calibrated fixed +80 positive range maps linearly to 0..14; this range is derived from the now-active affinity catalogue (exact legal-shape searches reached 79 raw points) and prevents routine Playstyle-rich XI saturation. Negative semantic opposition maps through the declared negative cap.","drain_efficiency":"After the Drain Limit hard gate, map raw condition-drain score from the theoretical minimum eligible plan to the selected limit ceiling: minimum=10 points and ceiling=0 points. Ceilings are Low 40, Medium 65, High 100."},"tie_break_order":["higher core tactic score outside 0.5-point semantic near-tie band","fewer contradiction penalties inside the near-tie band","higher semantic fit inside the near-tie band (for example both flanks when both own lanes are equally strongest)","higher exact tactic score when semantic fit ties","lower condition drain on exact score/semantic ties","more neutral/default settings","stable canonical option order"],"component_calibration":{"own_squad_structure":{"negative_cap":13,"positive_cap":31,"neutral_score":13,"max_score":26},"internal_coherence":{"negative_cap":10,"positive_cap":26,"neutral_score":9,"max_score":18},"playstyle_and_sa_fit":{"negative_cap":2,"positive_cap":80,"neutral_score":0,"max_score":14},"provenance":"Own-squad and coher